    {
      "@id": "jptr:compound-cbl",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": "jptr:compound-taxonomy",
      "skos:broader": "jptr:compound-minor",
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Cannabicyclol (CBL)",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "カンナビシクロール (CBL)",
          "@language": "ja"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "CBL",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "CBL リキッド",
          "@language": "ja"
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "compound_cbl",
      "skos:scopeNote": [
        {
          "@value": "`CBL` is the owner's term for **cannabicyclol**, confirmed by the owner on 2026-11-11. Identity and identifiers were verified against Wikidata Q907909 (en label 'cannabicyclol', CAS 21366-63-2, PubChem CID 30607, formula C21H30O2), the FDA GSRS record for UNII MP5WZK8M5U (substanceClass chemical, definitionLevel COMPLETE; names CANNABICYCLOL / CANNABIPINOL / PENTYLCANNABICYCLOL; CAS 21366-63-2, PubChem CID 59444380, formula C21H30O2) and PubChem CID 59444380 ('Cannabicyclol', stereospecified). PubChem CID 30607 is the stereo-unspecified / (+/-) record and carries CAS 67920-00-7 as a synonym, so the two CAS numbers circulate with different stereochemistry; this concept asserts no single CAS number as its identifier. The owner's query strings `CBL` and `CBL リキッド` are unchanged. The 2025 study of CBL describes it as a minor phytocannabinoid and reports acid-catalysed conversion of cannabichromene (CBC) to CBL, with the structure confirmed by X-ray crystallography (Haghdoost et al. 2025, J Nat Prod, DOI 10.1021/acs.jnatprod.4c00977, PMID 39811943); cannabicyclol has also been quantified among phytocannabinoids in cannabis material (PMID 33839545). Those detections do not establish enzymatic biosynthesis or occurrence in the intact living plant, and no biosynthetic route is asserted here. Placement in compound-minor therefore records only 'a phytocannabinoid other than the major pair'. The ja label follows the Japanese rendering used in Japanese-language scientific reporting (Wikidata's ja label is different); no chemical-class link is asserted because the chemical-class taxonomy has no CBL-type class, and no regulatory status is claimed. **Query limitation:** Google Trends and YouTube series for `CBL` measure occurrences of that literal string, not verified cannabicyclol content, and `CBL` is a short acronym that can match unrelated text. The existing samples are string-match observations, not proof of content relevance. Basis and source record: docs/provenance/compound-taxonomy.md (ISS-20261111-TAX-040 addendum).",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "`CBL` は owner が **cannabicyclol（カンナビシクロール）** を指す語として 2026-11-11 に確認した登録語である。同一性と識別子は Wikidata Q907909（en: cannabicyclol、CAS 21366-63-2、PubChem CID 30607、分子式 C21H30O2）、FDA GSRS の UNII MP5WZK8M5U 記録（substanceClass chemical、definitionLevel COMPLETE、名称 CANNABICYCLOL / CANNABIPINOL / PENTYLCANNABICYCLOL、CAS 21366-63-2、PubChem CID 59444380、分子式 C21H30O2）、PubChem CID 59444380（Cannabicyclol、立体指定あり）で検証した。PubChem CID 30607 は立体未指定（(±) 体）の記録で CAS 67920-00-7 を別名に持ち、2 つの CAS 番号は立体化学の扱いが異なるまま流通している。したがって単一の CAS 番号を本概念の識別子として断定しない。owner のクエリ文字列 `CBL` / `CBL リキッド` は変更しない。2025 年の CBL 研究は CBL を minor フィトカンナビノイドと記述し、cannabichromene（CBC）から酸触媒で CBL への変換を報告して X 線結晶構造で構造を確認している（Haghdoost et al. 2025, J Nat Prod, DOI 10.1021/acs.jnatprod.4c00977, PMID 39811943）。cannabicyclol はカンナビス材料中のフィトカンナビノイドとして定量もされている（PMID 33839545）。これらの検出は酵素的な生合成や intact な生植物での存在を確立するものではなく、本概念は生合成経路を主張しない。したがって `compound_minor` への配置は「主要な 2 化合物以外のフィトカンナビノイド」という範囲だけを記録する。日本語名は日本語の科学技術報告での表記に従う（Wikidata の ja ラベルとは表記が異なる）。`chemical-class-taxonomy` に CBL 型クラスは無いため化学クラスへのリンクは張らず、規制状態も主張しない。**クエリの限界:** Google Trends / YouTube の `CBL` 系列が測るのは文字列への一致であり、cannabicyclol の内容の確認ではない。`CBL` は無関係な語とも一致し得る短い略号であり、既存サンプルは文字列一致の観測である。根拠と出所は docs/provenance/compound-taxonomy.md（ISS-20261111-TAX-040 追記）。",
          "@language": "ja"
        }
      ],
      "skos:exactMatch": "wikidata:Q907909"
    },
    {
      "@id": "jptr:compound-cbga",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": "jptr:compound-taxonomy",
      "skos:broader": "jptr:compound-minor",
      "skos:prefLabel": [
